    "observedContracts": [
      "Response items are payload fields, with optional root harness metadata.",
      "FunctionCallOutputPayload does not serialize the internal success flag.",
      "Rollback counts actual user turns; inherited context and compacted replacements require separate reconstruction.",
      "Unknown response variants stay archived and do not authorize continuation.",
      "history_base.thread_id identifies an immutable rollout file; both the exclusive ordinal and byte offset are required and are distinct from the logical fork boundary.",
      "Compaction replacement_history contains plain ResponseItems with a separate parallel replacement_history_metadata array.",
      "Only the newest complete compaction can bound input replay; a checkpoint belonging to a rolled-back turn cannot replace a surviving older checkpoint.",
      "Context-only user fragments and synthetic compaction summaries do not consume rollback turns; queued assistant messages and function calls also follow user_input_order.",
      "Raw system messages stay in the archive and do not enter the selected model window; historical configuration and approvals are not current authority.",
      "Canonical reverted rollout filenames contain both a stable thread ID and an immutable physical rollout ID.",
      "Paginated lineage omits each physical file's metadata record; child content starts one ordinal after the inherited cutoff.",
      "Inherited cutoff bytes address logical JSONL bytes, and compressed sources require a separate bounded decoder."
    ]
